// Generated into the build tree by CMakeLists.txt so the manifest path is
// absolute: rc.exe's search for a bare file name does not reliably include the
// directory the .rc came from.
//
// 1 = CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID, 24 = RT_MANIFEST. Written as numbers
// because nothing here includes <winuser.h>.
1 24 "@WEBLINKED_MANIFEST_PATH@"
